This directory vendors the official v3.4.0 `toml.hpp` single-header release.
It was fetched from the official source archive:
https://github.com/marzer/tomlplusplus/archive/refs/tags/v3.4.0.tar.gz

Source archive SHA-256:
8517f65938a4faae9ccf8ebb36631a38c1cadfb5efa85d9a72e15b9e97d25155

Original upstream toml.hpp SHA-256:
6b5172ad4dd6519aec67b919181fa7a38a2234131e5b2afa232dfe444819783e

Local Modifications:
Apply key-component-limit.patch to the original single header. It introduces
an optional TOML_MAX_KEY_COMPONENTS guard before allocating dotted-key tables.
Our parser sets this and TOML_MAX_NESTED_VALUES to 16. The upstream value-depth
guard alone does not bound dotted table headers: a local 30,000-component input
caused recursive table destruction to exhaust the stack. Valid schema documents
need far fewer levels. The bounded input now returns a normal parse diagnostic.

The configuration core also defines TOML_EXCEPTIONS=0 before including toml.hpp
and is compiled with -fno-exceptions and -fno-rtti. No Chromium dependency was
modified; this is the product-owned vendored parser.

Patched toml.hpp SHA-256:
e41198eefff5c17cb154325d1698d67708ee1c81e0344fec5b35df08847df257
